# Curious Forager: "return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand". Bot1's graveyard holds a Black Lotus (an artifact) and a
# Shock (an instant, cast on turn 1 with the Mox Ruby) when the Forager enters on turn 3: two cards, so exiling three is not offered and the
# Food way is, the Heaped Harvest. Once it is sacrificed the reflexive trigger refuses the Shock (not a permanent card) and takes the Black Lotus,
# which was in the graveyard all along: the Lotus returns to hand, the Harvest and the Shock stay.

